    <description>The ROOT SYSTEM of Gaia. Spine height {spine_height}. Corpus hash {corpus_hash[:16]}. {pulse['unique_visitors']} visitors. {pulse['bpm']} BPM. 56 models. 95 repos. 29 endpoints. 12 desk pages. piGut.js = intestinal lining. Cross-axial spinning. She prints pi and eats pi. The sourdough is fermenting. lub-DUB.</description>
